{
  "description": "Reviewed licence of every vcpkg port APP depends on, directly or through the installed trees (P-30, spec 4.3, rule 070). scripts/check-licences.ps1 validates it; scripts/update-notices.ps1 builds THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md from it. 'version' is the version whose licence was verified: changing a port version without re-verifying and updating the entry fails the check. 'role' is linked, test, build (build time only, not linked) or system (operating-system library; needs a note). 'licence' is an SPDX expression; 'usedUnder' names the option APP uses when it is a choice; 'note' records where the vcpkg port metadata differs or is missing.",
